    "summary": "git_diff reads numstat with -z and parses literal old/new paths for renames; the body's truncated flag follows the shell's stdoutTruncated; a cut or mid-record numstat read fails the call. splitDiffByFile (now exported for its unit test) decodes git's quoted diff headers. The argv tests in diff.test.ts and git-diff-paths.test.ts now expect -z. Left out: git_show has its own copy of the old numstat parser; it is outside this LLD's surface.",
